{"script":"m_3_8_5","des":"消失村民艾婕的丈夫","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":590,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":590,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾婕的丈夫","text":"[show]哈？你们问艾婕那个贱人？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾婕的丈夫","text":"[show]我怎么会知道她跑去哪儿了？你们问我，我问谁？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":590,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"贝尔卡","text":"[show]这位先生，您应该知道些什么才对。如果您想不起来，这几枚阿比能帮您想到些什么吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":590,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾婕的丈夫","text":"[show]就这么点？你们打发叫花子哪！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"img":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","layer":"chara1"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哦？连银币都帮不了你是吧？那好，我这白生生的拳头，够不够帮你想起来啊？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara1","noOut":false,"img":"chara002_2","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","y":-180,"mirrow":false,"x":50,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾婕的丈夫","text":"[show]啊这——够、够了！银币就够了！真的够了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾婕的丈夫","text":"[show]啧……大概十几天前，有人找上门来，说可以带她去大市集当什么服务生。结果过不了多久，就听说她人在路上就走丢了，没了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"艾婕的丈夫","text":"[show]事情就是这样！再多我就不知道了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara036_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara036_1_face_chara036_1f","y":-218,"mirrow":false,"x":590,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"bright":0.6},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"layer":"chara3"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"layer":"chara3","noOut":false,"img":"chara051_1","noIn":false,"addImg":"chara051_1_face_chara051_1h","y":-304,"mirrow":false,"x":450,"scaleY":1,"bright":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"par